  "survey_protocol_notes": "Five dedicated SER systems, three open audio LLMs and two API systems. All ten completed sixteen dataset cohorts. Dedicated SER scores are restricted to dataset candidates when selecting a prediction. Generative systems have no fixed SER classification head and generate text from 4–7 dataset-specific candidates. JL-Corpus excited accepts happy or surprised; it is not an extra native output class. Full speech-backbone pretraining sources are not identical to the SER-task training datasets shown in this column. A missing complete corpus inventory does not prove a dataset was unseen."
